OL,3,AWhy Harry and Meghan's UK relaunch felt
OL,4,Aso much like a royal engagement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was something so very familiar
OL,7,Fabout today.
OL,9,FThe first time the Duke and Duchess of
OL,10,FSussex visited Nottingham together in
OL,11,F2017 they were plain old Prince Harry
OL,12,Fand Meghan Markle. They'd just
OL,13,Fannounced they were getting married and
OL,14,Fit was in the East Midlands that an
OL,15,FAmerican actress would be hard launched
OL,16,Fas a working member of the Royal
OL,17,FFamily.
OL,19,FYou could view today as the UK-relaunch
OL,20,Fof Meghan.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
