OL,3,AWhy Harry and Meghan's UK relaunch felt
OL,4,Aso much like a royal engagement
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe'd not done anything like the day of
OL,7,Fevents in Nottingham for several years
OL,8,Fon British soil. Those close to her
OL,9,Ftold me she wasn't nervous about how
OL,10,Fpeople would react to her and she
OL,11,Fwanted to get out there.
